lse"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b8ff6bb58783a25\" href=\"?note=4b8ff6bb58783a25\" title=\"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension\">43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50e83f9005c41f2a\" href=\"?note=50e83f9005c41f2a\" title=\"43-df-box-counting-dimension\">43-df-box-counting-dimension</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\le\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)\\le\\underline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E)\\le\\overline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E)\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\le\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)\\le\\underline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E)\\le\\overline{\\operatorname{dim}}_{\\mathrm B}(E)\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>低box维数控制某个趋长圆柱覆盖子序列的数量，从而控制Hausdorff维数。全部2^n个圆柱给上界1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"4b8ff6bb58783a25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-box-counting-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"50e83f9005c41f2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-box-counting-dimension]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"4b8ff6bb58783a25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"